# A box over several attackers, aimed (the operator, 2026-10-19: "if i have 10
# creatures and i draw a box, they might all get auto-targeted to a
# planeswalker on board"). Seat 0 (human) has three untapped, non-sick
# creatures of three different names (so the board draws three cards, never
# one pile) at its own Main Phase 1, nothing pre-declared, so Forge's live
# `InputAttack` opens for real — `attackers-declared.state`'s shape. Seat 1
# controls Jace Beleren as a second possible defender beside seat 1 itself;
# `|Counters:LOYALTY=3` for the reason `w46-b-planeswalker.state` gives (at the
# default zero Jace dies to state-based actions before the test can aim).
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=
humanbattlefield=Memnite;Ornithopter;Grizzly Bears
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=
aihand=
aibattlefield=Jace Beleren|Counters:LOYALTY=3
ailibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
aigraveyard=
